+    /// A finger held still with an item that is used by holding: use held until it
+    /// lifts (Bedrock eats, draws a bow, raises a shield so).
+    Holding { last: [f64; 2], start: [f64; 2], since: Instant },
+    /// On a hotbar slot: held for `DROP_MS` it drops the slot's stack.
+    Slot { slot: usize, since: Instant },
